      "欢迎通过 [CatsCo Platform Issues](https://github.com/buildsense-ai/cats-company/issues) 或 [XiaoBa Runtime Issues](https://github.com/buildsense-ai/XiaoBa-CLI/issues) 提交缺陷、架构建议和真实使用场景。",
